      "id": "28",
      "titleZh": "授权速查与常见坑",
      "titleEn": "License Basics",
      "introZh": "这是整个仓库最该先读的一篇。**\"免费下载\"≠\"可以商用\"≠\"可以不署名\"**，三件事互不相等。 收录条款本身 + 8 条实操避坑清单。 ⚠️ **免责声明**：本篇内容整理于 2026-10，仅供参考，**不构成法律意见**。涉及重大商业利益时请咨询专业法务，并以素材站官方许可页面原文为准。",
      "introEn": "This is the most important page to read first in the whole repo. **\"Free to download\" ≠ \"free to use commercially\" ≠ \"free to use without attribution\"** — the three are not equivalent. It covers the license terms themselves plus an 8-item practical pitfalls checklist.",
      "notesZh": [],
      "notesEn": [
        "⚠️ **Disclaimer**: This page was compiled in 2026-10 for reference only and **does not constitute legal advice**. Consult a professional for matters involving significant commercial interests, and defer to the original license pages on the asset sites."
      ],
